      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠬᠣᠷᠣᠬᠳᠠᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>qoroqdaγulqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хорогдуулах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XORUΓDAΓUL-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. caus. of xoruγda-] To cause to diminish, deduct, reduce, shorten, curtail, retrench.</definition>
      <page>969</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠯᠪᠠᠨ ᠡᠭᠦᠷᠭᠡ ᠎ᠶᠢ ᠬᠣᠷᠣᠬᠳᠠᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>alban egyrge ji --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To reduce taxes or imposts.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠠᠷᠤᠯᠭ᠎ᠠ ᠨᠤᠭᠤᠳ ᠢ ᠬᠣᠷᠣᠬᠳᠠᠭᠣᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>zarulγ-a nuyud i --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To reduce expenses.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
